% I am real novice in celtic music and often I
% feel I have heard this tune somewhere else.
% As a little experiment I used my program,
% abcmatch, to search for the bar A2AB AGEG
% and all its transposes in my abc database.
% Here are some of the hits I got. The results
% seem to suggest this is a strong motif in
% many tunes. The tunes Loch Leven Castle,
% Humours of Tuamgreine, and Tuamgreine Castle
% are very similar. Also the tunes Seeing to the
% Sheep and Galway Farmer also have a strong
% resemblance.


% seymour.shlien@crc.ca


